    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81720b15322f0ab588d62919",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我培养的孩子站上赛场，她的后继者再刻下更深的蹄迹――",
      "source_fingerprint": "a69736df9b53a5e47a92c85c20a876a3ca0056a161598df5e99b440d761a0008",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3923400032a40ba6be56bd94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:166f9cd7a56364a02510cfc0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如同山间的溪流变成大河，注入大海一般。\n传承、扩散，直到水平线的彼方，将这份心愿传递。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69bd672b0b4396104fb4ad6f779244c1d5c707fe17d927dcb77ec09c5a637379",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a05589f1853fbbdad1f6d090",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c1a4a4486c4a6b47133bee8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想成为滋养终将到来的未来的养分。\n即使这具身体长大成人……乃至衰老得如同枯枝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aba18eb508a3e47a3c52f2fd6dd7f29752e7e82a36c00c337ff408650dde872",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:baa8e812b06e1c1c9fa44388",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c43b8b8018410c771954fbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是……『成为』未来赛马娘的基石――\n用尽此生，我想要完成的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df3e9c5a419fd7f3fdeacb0997f44f2f92e624edc54d100ccd137b55f1777a0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a937d10dbb9476cc2b2b50a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心脏，再度开始狂跳不止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68f3861a4a37017b9378ff558de2589a3365da80c461dadc5394164529eaac14",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cb5c3b57d19747b19fc3662",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（在这之间的『当下』，有她们存在）",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b721364295864cf0db034dd574f35945bacafe73b6d9600ef7dcba3505f852b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f81ba453cf7b1ab2e47be39",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超越世代，绵延不绝的赛马娘们的系谱。\n如同从遥远的上游注入彼方大海，过去与未来相连着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3f72281234655139ca4451dfe896b1cbd268cc6f070fab330249d66d4a84118",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435281038765b118b5cab68a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "格局宏大得令人目眩。\n西沙里奥所望见的，是比当下更加遥远的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22eba7391231790c946d51e35927573eab659b54856c2de34f398aafe116eb41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95b49640886aefd4459dae15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好厉害的梦想啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c4a8965ddebbbb3b60870693966424d8bc8b27d9215dcdcf6a89999d9b192e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb6e1880b27edf6e4f06391",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好厉害的梦想呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "49ecfeebd701abc83fb26ebf9c64ac570e0634bc3b7e8d24735895efd19d97fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aad4fd389b6421986f82e29a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像尚未结籽的豆荚，或将红未红的青苹果――\n面对这样一位尚带稚气的赛马娘所描绘的宏大愿景，又怎能不深受震撼呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbfb721b658e67bd5ec7c337f28e02c9459b794e0b0d342cf0af7807b897e89b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4915751dded9749f04da7e51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……『也就是说要有足以成为』基石，的器量吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "aebb2d23c0cc7f4f412095ecb1c4a0346c067b1498a5f040e45c8c2f230abd5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
