      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e2e8aaca8f8ad5032e44133",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太阳沉入楼群背后，夜幕从东边天际逼近。\n真想把这份深沉的爱慕，永远藏进那片夜色里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d7166662ec70b49ef3a40e64281d0794390d71ae672c1e20ad514b5db4af4b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4500f0355a29aca532e946fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……等等，现在可不是沉浸在戏剧人物心境里的时候。\n我必须思考，自己能为西沙里奥做些什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f28ae78b342a65c8354e99237aba169908e907fcef9529f8631675d7802e89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4b11be58eda66ffb1f0c09f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她口中的『搭档』一词，其本质究竟是什么。\n能够站在西沙里奥身边的训练员会是什么样的人――？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07bbbbd32ea5a19796bf382246cc3661009f10eec90caf179434e7d205c4856e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110003.json",
      "json_path": [
