      "uid": "zhcn:de01dfc3265e1ef3c48ed426",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "茫然低垂的视线尽头，气槽出现了。\n这意想不到的人物登场，宛若悲剧顿转喜剧的救星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b983e54a07643affde1b4faa599842c012dcff7126b93c10c02075a62f9d91",
